    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method return type</a> is supported by any registered\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "给定<a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法返回类型</a>是否由任何已注册的<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</code></a>支持。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the given <a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "添加给定的<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the given <a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandlers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "添加给定的<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandlers</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Iterate over registered <a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandlers</code></a> and invoke the one that supports it.",
      "translation": "遍历已注册的<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandlers</code></a>并调用支持它的那个。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Handles method return values by delegating to a list of registered\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandlers</code></a>.\nPreviously resolved return types are cached for faster lookups.",
      "translation": "通过委托给已注册的`HandlerMethodReturnValueHandlers`列表来处理方法的返回值。<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandlers</code></a>。以前解析的返回类型会被缓存以加快查找速度。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a read-only list with the registered handlers, or an empty list.",
      "translation": "返回已注册处理程序的只读列表，或返回空列表。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsReturnType</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler` 接口中的 <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsReturnType</a></code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#handleReturnValue(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">handleReturnValue</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler` 接口中的 `<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#handleReturnValue(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">handleReturnValue</a>`",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the type of the return value. This type must have\npreviously been passed to <a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must\nhave returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 返回值的类型。此类型必须先前已传递给<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if no suitable <a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</code></a> is found.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果找不到合适的<a href=\"HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if this handler supports the supplied return type;\n<code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果此处理器支持提供的返回类型；否则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - if the return value handling results in an error",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 如果返回值处理导致错误",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the method return type to check",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 要检查的方法返回类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
